2.bug_scenario:
When you run the Lighthouse CLI against a URL that lacks a protocol (for example

  node lighthouse-cli www.example.com --view

) the core runner throws an LHError with code INVALID_URL before any i18n initialization has happened. Because the ICU template has never been formatted, the CLI ends up printing the raw template ID (“lighthouse-core/lib/lh-error.js | urlInvalid # 0”) instead of a localized, human-readable message.
